comment_body:
![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The comparison of form identity properties (`formIdentifier`, `viewId`, `focusedElementId`, and `associateFocusedElementByAttribute`) is duplicated between the assertions here and the configuration check in `applyConfiguration`. Extracting this comparison into a helper method on `EngineAutofillForm` (e.g., `hasSameIdentity`) improves maintainability and readability.

```suggestion
  bool hasSameIdentity(EngineAutofillForm other) {
    return formIdentifier == other.formIdentifier &&
        viewId == other.viewId &&
        focusedElementId == other.focusedElementId &&
        associateFocusedElementByAttribute == other.associateFocusedElementByAttribute;
  }

  void updateFrameworkConfiguration(EngineAutofillForm configuration) {
    assert(hasSameIdentity(configuration));
```

<details>
<summary>References</summary>

1. Suggest simplification and refactoring: Assess whether the code can be made simpler or refactored to enhance readability and maintainability. <sup>([link](https://github.com/flutter/flutter/blob/master/.gemini/styleguide.md))</sup>
</details>

