![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

On Vulkan 1.0 devices/drivers, `vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2` is not a core function and might only be available as `vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2KHR` via the `VK_KHR_get_physical_device_properties2` extension. We should query `vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2KHR` as a fallback to ensure maximum compatibility.

```suggestion
  auto vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2Func =
      reinterpret_cast<PFN_vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2>(
          vk_->AcquireProc("vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2",
                           vulkan::VulkanHandle<VkInstance>{instance}));
  if (!vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2Func) {
    vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2Func =
        reinterpret_cast<PFN_vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2>(
            vk_->AcquireProc("vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2KHR",
                             vulkan::VulkanHandle<VkInstance>{instance}));
  }
  if (vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2Func) {
    vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2Func(device_.GetPhysicalDeviceHandle(),
                                     &features2);
  }
```

