+  // YUV formats (e.g. NV12) only register kRGB_888x in Skia's GrVkCaps,
+  // so we must use kRGB_888x for YUV. For non-YUV formats, map the VkFormat
+  // to the corresponding SkColorType to handle BGRA and other formats
+  // correctly.
