comment_body:
I agree with @chunhtai . I propose the following way:
```dart
      late final Scene scene;
      _profile!.record('sceneBuildDuration', () {
        scene = sceneBuilder.build();
      }, reported: false);
      await _profile!.recordAsync('windowRenderDuration', () async {
        // On the web, render is asynchronous.
        await (PlatformDispatcher.instance as dynamic).render(scene);
      }, reported: false);
```

Because `sceneBuildDuration` should only record `sceneBuilder.build` and should not include `windowRenderDuration` in a nested way.

However, this kind of change is out of the scope of a refactoring PR. I suggest we remove changing this file from this PR and instead do it in a different PR.

